# Development Workflow

## Environment Setup
- Node.js >= 18.20.1
- NPM >= 10.5.0 or Yarn >= 1.22.19 (preferred)
- Install dependencies with `yarn install`

## Development Commands
- `yarn dev` or `quasar dev` - Start web app in development mode
- `yarn dev:electron` or `quasar dev -m electron` - Start Electron app in development mode
- `yarn lint` - Lint code using ESLint

## Building for Production
- Web: `quasar build` - Builds for web
- MacOS: `yarn build-mac` - Builds for macOS
- Windows: `yarn build-win` - Builds for Windows
- Linux: `yarn build-linux` - Builds for Linux

## ESLint Configuration
The project uses ESLint with Vue and Standard configuration:
- [.eslintrc.js](mdc:.eslintrc.js) - ESLint configuration
- [.eslintignore](mdc:.eslintignore) - Files to ignore for linting

## Deployment
- Web deployment uses S3 uploads configured in [s3-spa-upload.config.json](mdc:s3-spa-upload.config.json)
- Different deployment targets (dev1, staging, prod) are available through environment variables
